  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "m_event_id": 800001,
    "m_character_id": 1300002,
    "character_asset_id": "300601000",
    "position": 1,
    "serif": "大穴で産出される武具は\nミレスガルドの戦力強化に有益\n優先的に買い取らせて欲しい",
    "serif_type": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "m_event_id": 800001,
    "m_character_id": 1300002,
    "character_asset_id": "300601000",
    "position": 1,
    "serif": "王都の防衛で手が離せぬ今、\n前線の指揮は\nあの男に任せるしかない、か……",
    "serif_type": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "m_event_id": 800001,
    "m_character_id": 1300002,
    "character_asset_id": "300601000",
    "position": 1,
    "serif": "ソフィアが信頼する人物……\nその手並み拝見させてもらうぞ",
    "serif_type": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 8000021,
    "m_event_id": 800002,
    "m_character_id": 1300002,
    "character_asset_id": "300701000",
    "position": 1,
    "serif": "お姉様も無茶言うわね……\r\n司令官、悪いんだけど\r\nお願い出来るかしら？",
    "serif_type": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 8000022,
    "m_event_id": 800002,
    "m_character_id": 1300002,
    "character_asset_id": "300701000",
    "position": 1,
    "serif": "見定めさせてもらうわ。\n彼がこの世界の命運を託すに\n値する人物かどうか……",
    "serif_type": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 8000023,
    "m_event_id": 800002,
    "m_character_id": 1300002,
    "character_asset_id": "300701000",
    "position": 1,
    "serif": "魔術の発展のためにも\n魔石の解析は重要課題。\n優先的に回していただける？",
    "serif_type": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "m_event_id": 900001,
    "m_character_id": 1300002,
    "character_asset_id": "101101000G",
    "position": 1,
    "serif": "いざ、鍛錬と参りましょう",
    "serif_type": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "m_event_id": 900001,
    "m_character_id": 1300002,
    "character_asset_id": "101101000G",
    "position": 1,
    "serif": "この剣、我が主君のために",
    "serif_type": 0
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "m_event_id": 900001,
    "m_character_id": 1300002,
    "character_asset_id": "101101000G",
    "position": 1,
    "serif": "特別手当、出ませんかね",
    "serif_type": 0
